  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/CoffeeDelight.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"148\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>欢迎来到咖啡惊喜！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这是《农夫乐事》的另一个附属模组！它将咖啡豆带入了 Minecraft 的世界！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你想制作一杯咖啡，首先需要在沙漠中找到一些咖啡树。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">砍下咖啡浆果并烤熟咖啡豆，然后再次加工制成咖啡粉。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">现在，让我们制作壶和杯子来煮咖啡吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/CuccumelaPot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"813\" height=\"172\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/MokaPot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"812\" height=\"172\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/TurkeyPot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"812\" height=\"172\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/MakeCup.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"170\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">当你做好咖啡壶后，将其放在热源上加热，放入咖啡粉并等待咖啡煮好，然后用杯子盛满！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">小心！如果煮太久，咖啡会变成糊状！我们可不喜欢喝烧焦的咖啡，对吧？ :(</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">别担心！聪明先生会帮助我们的！使用聪明先生可以更快速、更好地制作黑咖啡！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/MakeCoffeeByMrClever.png\" width=\"817\" height=\"173\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">利用黑咖啡制作更多其他饮品！品尝所有咖啡吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">尝试自己制作更多的咖啡，享受咖啡的美味吧！玩得开心 :) </span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/AllItem.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/Breakfast.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
